TEXT 176 -752 Left 4 ;For transformer parameter see wxmaxima file in this folder
TEXT 408 -272 Left 2 ;If there is a 3x1 limbs core the samephased magnetic flow \ncan always go the iron path ( similar to the 5leg core)\nand not the path over air and oilcettle \nSo the magnetic resistance is very small and the \ncorresponding reactance is very high \nIn fact X0 is nearly Xh (the main inductance)
TEXT 408 -640 Left 2 ;If you know X0 of your YY transformer\nyou can change rkessel (default=1e20) \nto a appropriate value so that your X0 is the simulation result\nAt 1e20 (default)  the magnetic kettleflow is not considered\nHINT: You can see that not only the value of X0 but also\nthe shape of the inrush currents is determined by the kettleflow.\nTherefore for accurate simulation it is important to set rkessel\nto a better value as 1e20
